Fallon Looney: Awesome.

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:42.000
Carmen Cruickshank: And just go over the, uh…

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:44.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Just Google Ads in general.

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:50.000
Fallon Looney: Yes. Random question. For the…

00:02:50.000 --> 00:03:02.000
Fallon Looney: uh… the… the guy that was in office hours, which we might get to maybe when we meet with Jacqueline, um… is he a full-service client, or is he just in the…

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:05.000
Fallon Looney: Accelerator.

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:08.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Yeah, he's just in the accelerator.

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:08.000
Fallon Looney: Got it, okay.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:16.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Honestly, yeah, at this point, I'm at a loss of what to do for them, because we've had that client for over a year, and…

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:16.000
Fallon Looney: Mm-hmm.

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:18.000
Carmen Cruickshank: I don't think you've met…

00:03:18.000 --> 00:03:26.000
Carmen Cruickshank: I think it's, like, his girlfriend, I don't know, but actually, like, the woman that started with us, like… so Felipe is, like, her assistant.

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:28.000
Fallon Looney: Okay.

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:42.000
Carmen Cruickshank: And so I think we figured out that there are couples. So, anyway, they started with us a year ago, and they started as a full service client. And I started here also a little bit over a year ago. So like April 2025.

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:31.000
Fallon Looney: Ugh!

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:37.000
Fallon Looney: Mm-hmm.

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:43.000
Fallon Looney: Yep.

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:52.000
Carmen Cruickshank: And, uh, I knew Google Ads, and they were still training me in Meta, but they… Whitney wanted me to do both Google and Meta for them, just because they find it easier for full-service clients to just…

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:54.000
Fallon Looney: Yeah.

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:56.000
Carmen Cruickshank: You know, it doesn't need to go back and forth. And so…

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:55.000
Fallon Looney: Yep.

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:57.000
Carmen Cruickshank: um…

00:03:57.000 --> 00:04:13.000
Carmen Cruickshank: I don't know. They were like very, she was like, Oh, it's week four. We don't have this yet. Which like makes sense. Like I understand you're paying for this. So you want everything on time, but, uh, I don't know. They're just honestly a very, very picky client. And we figured out some things with like landing page changes and maybe like some leads came in more from.

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:14.000
Fallon Looney: Okay.

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:14.000
Carmen Cruickshank: But, uh…

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:20.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Yeah, at this point, like, they've never honestly done well on Google Ads, and…

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:35.000
Carmen Cruickshank: I am at a loss of, like, I genuinely don't know what to do, but of course I can't really say that to him, so I'm just like, okay, like, we can circle back, we'll figure it out, we'll talk to Whitney about the funnel, because there's always something to fix, but I just, I don't know. So, if you have.

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:27.000
Fallon Looney: Okay.

00:04:54.000 --> 00:05:10.000
Fallon Looney: like, what they do, you know what I mean? It's like, are they… I assume, are they, like, a planning service for destination weddings? That's kind of what I got from it, but again, I have, like, no context, and maybe that's good that I don't have context, you know?

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:57.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Okay.

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:03.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Yeah.

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:07.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Mm-hmm.

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:08.000
Carmen Cruickshank: It's good.

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:20.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Mm-hmm. No, I completely agree, because it's like, you should know pretty clearly what it is. And I feel like when people are going on ads, like, they're just like, I just want to know, and if it's not clear, then it… they bounce off.

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:14.000
Fallon Looney: Yeah.

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:21.000
Fallon Looney: Mm-hmm. Mm-hmm.

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:25.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Uh, yeah, so basically, like, they're a destination wedding planner, and…

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:31.000
Carmen Cruickshank: travel agent at the same time, so they help with, like, the hotels and everything. I feel like they should have that up front, like…

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:29.000
Fallon Looney: Mmhm.

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:33.000
Fallon Looney: Yeah, like…

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:34.000
Carmen Cruickshank: I actually want to see their landing page real quick.

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:44.000
Fallon Looney: Yeah, because it almost… I felt like when I looked at the landing page, and especially, like, above the fold, which is, like, that's the, you know, section of the page where.

00:05:44.000 --> 00:06:01.000
Fallon Looney: That's like all you see. And they're mainly talking about finding the perfect venue. And it's like, well, I can do that. Like, I, I almost feel like if I was reading that they handle things for me, like.

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:53.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Hmm…

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:57.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Do that. Hmm.

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:06.000
Fallon Looney: From top to bottom, and handle all the travel, and…

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:12.000
Fallon Looney: I almost feel like they need a one-liner about what the service…

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:13.000
Fallon Looney: Um…

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:21.000
Fallon Looney: does, which maybe the copy and creative does that, but I feel like it should be more clear on the page, too, you know?

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:24.000
Carmen Cruickshank: It should, because when I think about it now, it's like…

00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:24.000
Fallon Looney: Hmm. Okay.

00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:28.000
Carmen Cruickshank: kind of vague, and it kind of has the things that are needed. So like.

00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:38.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Uh, oh, like, here's some testimonials, and, like, what we do, and, you know, questions, and all these different, you know, testimonials, and notes, and all this stuff.

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:39.000
Fallon Looney: Mmhm.

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:43.000
Fallon Looney: Mmhm.

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:53.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Uh, and maybe they have the video here, which, like, explains it all, but at the same time, I feel like people scrolling, like, maybe they're in public and they don't want to watch a video, so it's like, they just want.

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:47.000
Fallon Looney: Okay.

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:53.000
Fallon Looney: Mm-hmm.

00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:58.000
Carmen Cruickshank: And even, like, here when it says, like, consultation contract, like, it's like, you know, the alliteration.

00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:59.000
Fallon Looney: Yeah.

00:06:58.000 --> 00:07:06.000
Carmen Cruickshank: I feel like people don't want to act… it's funny, I feel like people just don't want to read. Like, they want it to be clear in bullets or something. So I feel like if up here it was, like…

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:17.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Destination, wedding, planner, and travel agent. That would be so clear. And then it's like, we serve in Mexico and the Caribbean.

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:18.000
Fallon Looney: Right.

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:22.000
Carmen Cruickshank: And we take care of so many things for you, or something like that. And then it's like…

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:24.000
Carmen Cruickshank: uh…

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:27.000
Carmen Cruickshank: what we do, like what we actually do.

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:33.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Uh, so it's like, we discuss the destination budget, vibe of your day, venues, all these things.

00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:33.000
Fallon Looney: Okay.

00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:39.000
Carmen Cruickshank: like, I feel like if it was structured like that, it would be so much better, so we could definitely let that… let Felipe know.

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:48.000
Fallon Looney: Yeah. I agree. Like, this almost needs to be like their, not like their pitch, but you know what I mean. It needs to…

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:42.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Um, yeah.

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:55.000
Fallon Looney: kind of summarize everything that they do. And I think that maybe they're losing people.

00:07:56.000 --> 00:08:01.000
Fallon Looney: You know, with that. Even if they need to move the video up.

00:07:57.000 --> 00:07:59.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Mm-hmm.

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:02.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Mm-hmm.

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:13.000
Fallon Looney: if they feel like the video is relevant or something. I don't know. But I'm sure the page has something to do with it. Maybe their ad copy, but…

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:06.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Mm-hmm.

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:16.000
Fallon Looney: Regardless, I think the page.

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:19.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Yeah, I feel like if this part changed.

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:21.000
Carmen Cruickshank: It would change so much.

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:23.000
Carmen Cruickshank: uh…

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:29.000
Carmen Cruickshank: And I also find it interesting, because I was like, oh, like, 20% of people go from the page to the…

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:35.000
Carmen Cruickshank: uh… inquiry form, but they're not actually inquiring. So in my mind, I'm like…

00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:36.000
Fallon Looney: Oh, interesting.

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:43.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Yeah, I feel like they're just looking for more information, though, and of course, when they just see a form, they're like, oh, no, I'm out. So…

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:45.000
Fallon Looney: Yeah, because there may be still unclear.

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:49.000
Fallon Looney: On, like, why am I…

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:53.000
Fallon Looney: Because I don't think the form is the issue. I feel like they're asking just pretty basic.

00:08:53.000 --> 00:08:55.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Questions?

00:08:54.000 --> 00:09:04.000
Fallon Looney: information, like, that people, you know, genuinely looking. I think the hero of the landing page would probably make a huge difference.

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:10.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Yeah, that makes sense. I feel like it definitely would. Yeah, we could probably have like, mm-hmm.

00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:14.000
Fallon Looney: And maybe adding… oh yeah, sorry, I was gonna say maybe adding the button to, um…

00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:20.000
Fallon Looney: To click right above the fold as well so that then they're like, oh, perfect.

00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:21.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Mm-hmm.

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:22.000
Fallon Looney: This is what I'm looking for.

00:09:21.000 --> 00:09:23.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Mm-hmm.

00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:24.000
Fallon Looney: I also am like…

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:40.000
Fallon Looney: And there could certainly be a market for it. Um, maybe it just is… maybe I'm just not their customer, but are people even still using, like, travel agents anymore? I mean, that would kind of be, like…

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:34.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Hmm.

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:40.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Hmm.

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:41.000
Fallon Looney: You know.

00:09:41.000 --> 00:09:43.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Mm-hmm. No, that makes sense.

00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:49.000
Fallon Looney: That's their business, so there's nothing we can do there, but I guess, is the audience pool just small?

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:46.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Thank you.

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:55.000
Carmen Cruickshank: I think that's why she combined both, because, like, if people want a destination wedding, they definitely get, like, a destination wedding planner.

00:09:55.000 --> 00:09:57.000
Fallon Looney: Mm-hmm.

00:09:55.000 --> 00:10:04.000
Carmen Cruickshank: But I think she just combined the travel agent thing, just, like, in case for those logistics that are needed. But she's ultimately, like, marketing herself as, like, the planner.

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:02.000
Fallon Looney: Mm-hmm.

00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:09.000
Fallon Looney: The planner, yeah. And even then, we're not even clear that…

00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:06.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Good.

00:10:23.000 --> 00:10:24.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Mm-hmm.

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:27.000
Fallon Looney: Like…

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:27.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Yeah, um…

00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:34.000
Fallon Looney: you know, it's like I'm not clear from this that, like, I'm opting in for a planner.

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:36.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Mm-hmm. That makes sense.

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:38.000
Fallon Looney: Umm.

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:47.000
Carmen Cruickshank: It's crazy how, like, it's so easy to look at the tiny things and the complicated things when it's, like, the most obvious things, like a headline, like, actually changes it. That's, yeah.

00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:43.000
Fallon Looney: Yeah.

00:10:44.000 --> 00:10:45.000
Fallon Looney: Yeah.

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:56.000
Fallon Looney: Yeah, and I mean, also, is the ad copy for the ads, like, are they doing Meta and Google?

