Fallon Looney: And not that I'm saying that Google Ads aren't right for them, but maybe it's like…

00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:15.000
Fallon Looney: you know, when you're… when you're scrolling, and you see the visual of the destiny, you know what I mean? Like, that could be…

00:13:09.000 --> 00:13:10.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Thank you.

00:13:16.000 --> 00:13:19.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Yeah, that could be what makes it better.

00:13:18.000 --> 00:13:21.000
Fallon Looney: Mm-hmm. Yeah.

00:13:20.000 --> 00:13:23.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Let's see, I'm going to…

00:13:23.000 --> 00:13:25.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Preview it.

00:13:24.000 --> 00:13:29.000
Fallon Looney: Yeah, I'm just out of curiosity.

00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:31.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Yeah, this one is just like, let me see.

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:47.000
Carmen Cruickshank: I agree. You don't need a travel agent to book your destination wedding. Why? Travel agents book travels. Destination wedding specialists, like me, help you plan your wedding and handle all the travel details for your guests.

