Carmen Cruickshank: There's a list. Lots of chat.

00:13:49.000 --> 00:13:51.000
Fallon Looney: Yeah.

00:13:50.000 --> 00:13:52.000
Carmen Cruickshank: So that one, like…

00:13:51.000 --> 00:13:54.000
Fallon Looney: So that's at least clear, you know.

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:59.000
Carmen Cruickshank: like, what they do. The thing is, it got a lot of reach. It's not, like, the most effective for leads, but I want to see…

00:13:59.000 --> 00:14:01.000
Carmen Cruickshank: This one because I forgot.

00:14:07.000 --> 00:14:15.000
Carmen Cruickshank: You're dreaming of getting married somewhere beautiful, in Mexico or the Caribbean, with your favorite people, but you have no idea where to start? That's where I come in.

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:29.000
Carmen Cruickshank: I work with couples to simplify the whole process, helping me find the perfect venue, contracting both the wedding and the room block, managing guest travel, and wedding settings. I've got you covered. And the best part? There's no cost to work with me.

00:14:26.000 --> 00:14:28.000
Fallon Looney: Yeah, I'm.

00:14:29.000 --> 00:14:37.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Get honest advice, genuine support, and someone who's really in your corner. It's done this many times before. You can enjoy the experience.

00:14:37.000 --> 00:14:56.000
Carmen Cruickshank: If you're curious to know if a destination wedding could work for you, let's chat. No pressure, just a conversation. We'll talk about the vision of your wedding day, the vibe, the setting, the guest experience, everything you're dreaming of. Next, I'll send a custom proposal with hand-picked venues, wedding details, roof rings, and freebies you'll print for hosting your destination wedding at that location.

00:14:56.000 --> 00:15:01.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Plus, an overview video to help you quickly focus on the venues you love most.

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:11.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Want to visit a venue before deciding? I'll set that up. I'll coordinate a meeting. Yeah, I don't… I didn't know it was that long, but uh…

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:29.000
Fallon Looney: Yeah, but I think that even, I think if anything, the fact that these are doing better also I think is even more of an argument about the headline on the page to bring some of the messaging from these ads onto the page for Google.

00:15:15.000 --> 00:15:16.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Mm-hmm.

00:15:29.000 --> 00:15:31.000
Carmen Cruickshank: Mm-hmm. Bye.

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:40.000
Fallon Looney: Because she's talking about, like, the ease of the experience, like, working with them, um, like, all of those…

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:49.000
Fallon Looney: value propositions I feel like she doesn't have on the header of the page. And it probably makes more sense that…

00:15:49.000 --> 00:15:50.000
Fallon Looney: Like.

00:15:50.000 --> 00:16:01.000
